Subject: Select original effects template resolution on retained native records

Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Share EffectsBundleData's final template-resolution loop with the original
initializer. Native storage is decoded and retained separately; prohibit the
Wii in-place pointer loaders and unselected user-effect parser. Nonzero native
user-spec destruction fails explicitly; its original factories are not linked.
Select original
ResolveTemplates, IsPersistent and cleanup routines only, without enabling the
EmissionManager or ParticleSystem. Native colour storage retains its exact
serialized count: owned records have 25 colours while the reconstructed console
array declares 26. No terminal colour or resource binding is fabricated.

